@startuml

salt
{
  <b>DEFINE HOW TENORS RESOLVE</b>
  Tenant Acme Capital - tenant_admin
  Refdata > Tenors - 3M under RATES_SPOT_FORWARD - horizon 2026-03-16 - GB.LOIOB - Following
  --
  {
    {
      <b>Steps</b>
      . Tenors
      . The tenor
      . Its resolution
      . The schedule
      . The resolved dates
      . Review
      . The outcome
      ..
      . History
      . The refusal
    } | {
      <b>Tenors</b>
      "Search: 3M, one month, or part of a description" | Kind: (all) (PERIOD) (SPECIAL)
      {#
        Code | Display Name | Kind | Unit | Order | Resolves to (RATES_SPOT_FORWARD) | Version
        <b>O/N</b> | Overnight | SPECIAL | NONE | 10 | 2026-03-18 | v1
        T/N | Tomorrow next | SPECIAL | NONE | 20 | 2026-03-19 | v1
        <b>3M</b> | Three month | PERIOD | MONTH x 3 | 60 | 2026-06-18 | v2
        1Y1Y | One year, one year forward | PERIOD | YEAR x 1 | 100 | 2027-06-18 | v2
      }
      [ Open the tenor ] | [ Add tenor ]
      --
      <b>The code a person reads</b> | <b>The resolution the system computes</b>
      <b>3M</b> | Anchor SPOT, plus 3 month.
      Three month | RATES_SPOT_FORWARD / ANCHOR_OFFSET / SPOT
      --
      {#
        Tenor | Convention | Calendar | Roll rule | Horizon
        ^3M^ | ^RATES_SPOT_FORWARD^ | ^GB.LOIOB^ | ^Following^ | "2026-03-16"
      }
      {#
        Step | What it is | Date
        Horizon | the as-of date every anchor is measured from | Mon 16 Mar 2026
        Anchor | SPOT, from the convention RATES_SPOT_FORWARD | Wed 18 Mar 2026
        Offset | +3 month from the anchor | Thu 18 Jun 2026
        Roll | Following on GB.LOIOB | Thu 18 Jun 2026
        <b>Resolved</b> | 3M under RATES_SPOT_FORWARD | Thu 18 Jun 2026
      }
      ! Refused at the schedule. ROLL_QUARTER has 9 dates on or after the walk start, and 1Y12RQ asks for 12.
      --
      {#
        Version | Changed by | Change reason | Commentary
        v2 | j.smith | DATA_FIX | Three months is a calendar quarter, not ninety days.
        v1 | tenant_admin | SEED | Seeded with the tenant.
      }
      {#
        Field | Version before | This version | Kind
        Display Name | - | Three month | added
        Unit | DAY | MONTH | changed
        Multiplier | 90 | 3 | changed
      }
      [ Revert to this version ]
    }
  }
}

@enduml
